        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% 1. 顶部：逻辑计算展开树 (Logical computation)\n    subgraph LC [\&quot;Logical computation\&quot;]\n        direction TB\n        Root[\&quot;root\&quot;]\n        \n        N1_1((\&quot; \&quot;))\n        N1_2((\&quot; \&quot;))\n        \n        N2_1((\&quot; \&quot;))\n        N2_2((\&quot; \&quot;))\n        N2_3((\&quot; \&quot;))\n        N2_4((\&quot; \&quot;))\n        \n        Root --- N1_1\n        Root --- N1_2\n        \n        N1_1 --- N2_1\n        N1_1 --- N2_2\n        N1_2 --- N2_3\n        N1_2 --- N2_4\n        \n        Branches[\&quot;...&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;potentially many&lt;br/&gt;logical branches&lt;/b&gt;\&quot;]\n        \n        N2_1 -.-&gt; Branches\n        N2_2 -.-&gt; Branches\n        N2_3 -.-&gt; Branches\n        N2_4 -.-&gt; Branches\n    end\n\n    %% 2. 映射过渡层 (mapping)\n    Branches --&gt;|mapping| S2\n\n    %% 3. 中间：有限物理资源槽 (Finite physical resources)\n    subgraph FPR [\&quot;Finite physical resources\&quot;]\n        direction LR\n        S1[\&quot;Slot 1\&quot;]\n        S2[\&quot;Slot 2\&quot;]\n        SD[\&quot;...\&quot;]\n        SP[\&quot;Slot P\&quot;]\n        \n        S1 ~~~ S2 ~~~ SD ~~~ SP\n    end\n\n    %% 4. 底部：等待分支状态 (双向交互)\n    S2 &lt;--&gt; PBS[\&quot;Pending branch states\&quot;]\n\n    %% 样式微调\n    style N1_1 fill:#2b2b2b,stroke:#2b2b2b,width:12px,height:12px\n    style N1_2 fill:#2b2b2b,stroke:#2b2b2b,width:12px,height:12px\n    style N2_1 fill:#2b2b2b,stroke:#2b2b2b,width:12px,height:12px\n    style N2_2 fill:#2b2b2b,stroke:#2b2b2b,width:12px,height:12px\n    style N2_3 fill:#2b2b2b,stroke:#2b2b2b,width:12px,height:12px\n    style N2_4 fill:#2b2b2b,stroke:#2b2b2b,width:12px,height:12px\n    style Branches fill:none,stroke:none\n    style SD fill:none,stroke:none\n    style PBS fill:#F9F9F9,stroke:#666,stroke-dasharray: 4 4&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2Pm2PMj3ao3HOi4b52a_-65">
